      "cooked": "<p>I have submitted a purchase receipt:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/4/142a481e0d5e4f3606e35f721d6fa09801b6765f.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/142a481e0d5e4f3606e35f721d6fa09801b6765f\" title=\"a1\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/4/142a481e0d5e4f3606e35f721d6fa09801b6765f_2_690x287.jpeg\" alt=\"a1\" data-base62-sha1=\"2So8wKrnjcE550iI3fbSMlf6kgf\" width=\"690\" height=\"287\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/4/142a481e0d5e4f3606e35f721d6fa09801b6765f_2_690x287.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/4/142a481e0d5e4f3606e35f721d6fa09801b6765f_2_1035x430.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/4/142a481e0d5e4f3606e35f721d6fa09801b6765f.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFAF9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">a1</span><span class=\"informations\">1352×564 58.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\nAccounting Ledger is showing value:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/0/400872fd38610609ab0e099e51fae9d958a545fe.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/400872fd38610609ab0e099e51fae9d958a545fe\" title=\"a2\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/0/400872fd38610609ab0e099e51fae9d958a545fe_2_690x135.jpeg\" alt=\"a2\" data-base62-sha1=\"98sEWwmKCC6MbWoO3Ztgw9oLyzk\" width=\"690\" height=\"135\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/0/400872fd38610609ab0e099e51fae9d958a545fe_2_690x135.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/0/400872fd38610609ab0e099e51fae9d958a545fe_2_1035x202.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/0/400872fd38610609ab0e099e51fae9d958a545fe_2_1380x270.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F4F4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">a2</span><span class=\"informations\">1561×307 79.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>From that purchase receipt, now i have created purchase invoice and added 17% VAT (checked option: Is this Tax included in Basic Rate?)<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/1/612acbe99e9e5437aa2a6272185122e19fd42185.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/612acbe99e9e5437aa2a6272185122e19fd42185\" title=\"a3\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/1/612acbe99e9e5437aa2a6272185122e19fd42185_2_690x480.jpeg\" alt=\"a3\" data-base62-sha1=\"dRA0meq48hoGDYnur2XcvSUkrtP\" width=\"690\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/1/612acbe99e9e5437aa2a6272185122e19fd42185_2_690x480.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/1/612acbe99e9e5437aa2a6272185122e19fd42185_2_1035x720.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/1/612acbe99e9e5437aa2a6272185122e19fd42185.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">a3</span><span class=\"informations\">1307×911 97.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\nAccounting Ledger is:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/a/fab8ecc459c60426d501cd7e24b274989addafff.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fab8ecc459c60426d501cd7e24b274989addafff\" title=\"a4\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/a/fab8ecc459c60426d501cd7e24b274989addafff_2_690x156.jpeg\" alt=\"a4\" data-base62-sha1=\"zLZzaMxVo40FVLJgp8HXYXVIS7B\" width=\"690\" height=\"156\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/a/fab8ecc459c60426d501cd7e24b274989addafff_2_690x156.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/a/fab8ecc459c60426d501cd7e24b274989addafff_2_1035x234.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/a/fab8ecc459c60426d501cd7e24b274989addafff_2_1380x312.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F3F3\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">a4</span><span class=\"informations\">1551×351 95.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>In my opinion , now system should revalue to item in stock ledger at 854.70. But it is still showing value 1000 for each unit.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/2/021927623004fb81b118396b823b7f486c0cbf82.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/021927623004fb81b118396b823b7f486c0cbf82\" title=\"a5\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/2/021927623004fb81b118396b823b7f486c0cbf82_2_690x95.jpeg\" alt=\"a5\" data-base62-sha1=\"iyQv5RifiF0Q4q0X6B75TbN6dY\" width=\"690\" height=\"95\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/2/021927623004fb81b118396b823b7f486c0cbf82_2_690x95.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/2/021927623004fb81b118396b823b7f486c0cbf82_2_1035x142.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/2/021927623004fb81b118396b823b7f486c0cbf82_2_1380x190.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F3F3\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">a5</span><span class=\"informations\">1500×207 47.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I have checked Repost Item Valuation also General Ledger:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/b/fbf5a395653adb31e61dd75254dfbd39083735d1.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fbf5a395653adb31e61dd75254dfbd39083735d1\" title=\"A6\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/b/fbf5a395653adb31e61dd75254dfbd39083735d1_2_690x193.jpeg\" alt=\"A6\" data-base62-sha1=\"zWW7HsB9sMGNgBwthh6UNzokeZj\" width=\"690\" height=\"193\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/b/fbf5a395653adb31e61dd75254dfbd39083735d1_2_690x193.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/b/fbf5a395653adb31e61dd75254dfbd39083735d1_2_1035x289.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/b/fbf5a395653adb31e61dd75254dfbd39083735d1_2_1380x386.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F4F3\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">A6</span><span class=\"informations\">1536×431 127 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></di